Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Generator: adaptive prefill chunks
 (EXL3_PREFILL_ADAPTIVE, default off)

Per-chunk memory limiter ported from QMesh R5 (qmesh/prefill_limit.py): shrinks each planned prefill chunk to fit free device memory. Opt-in; changes chunk boundaries and therefore long-context numerics.
---
 exllamav3/generator/generator.py     |   7 ++
 exllamav3/generator/job.py           |  10 +++
 exllamav3/generator/prefill_limit.py | 105 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 122 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 exllamav3/generator/prefill_limit.py

